  <item>
    <title>137 为啥普通话里夹英文，每次都被骂呀</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/68c7dc4ba56ca3e0c482edef</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">68c7dc4ba56ca3e0c482edef</guid>
    <pubDate>Wed, 17 Sep 2025 03:00:00 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>本期主播：lynn vs Serena</span></p><span></span><p><span>返场嘉宾：玲玲老师</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FprYYPbPIsvzmc6mrHAaWzu642PR.png"></figure><span></span><p><span>上一期我们仨录的节目竟然收到了听众差评，其中普通话里说英文是被诟病的点，本期不妨来聊聊大家到底在不爽什么。</span></p><span></span><p><span>-<a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="133">02:13</a> 被质疑"傲慢"的那一刻，内心发生了什么</span></p><span></span><p><span>-<a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="330">05:30</a> &nbsp;大家不爽的不是语言，是精英主义的傲慢</span></p><span></span><p><span>-<a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="952">15:52</a> 港式混搭的接受度：粤语夹英文的奇妙反应</span></p><span></span><p><span>-<a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="959">15:59</a> 我们关注的博主也有因为夹杂英文被骂的，最好的回应是什么</span></p><span></span><p><span>-<a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="994">16:34</a> 如果英文不可以，那么“普通话夹杂方言”你们觉得ok吗</span></p><span></span><p><span>-<a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1075">17:55</a> 方言的神秘感：温州话为什么像加密通话？</span></p><span></span><p><span>-<a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1515">25:15</a> 表达清楚意思，怎么讲都可以，语言只是工具而已</span></p><span></span><p><span>-<a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1201">20:01</a> 孩子的语言世界：两岁宝宝的新词炫耀时刻</span></p><span></span><p><span>-<a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1529">25:29</a> 方言的性格密码：杭州话像吵架，苏州话如撒娇</span></p><span></span><p><span>-<a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1705">28:25</a> 文化的有趣碰撞：外国博主说四川话为什么这么火？</span></p><span></span><p><span>-<a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1888">31:28</a> 回到语言本质：情感表达才是沟通的核心</span></p><span></span><p><span>如何表达是个人自由，我们既不提倡要刻意表达，也不受混搭表达的影响</span></p><span></span><p><span>除非你的表达真得让人听不懂！</span></p><span></span><p><span>轻松一点，开心一些</span></p><span></span><p><span>希望你们也有愉快收听本期闲聊哦。</span></p><span></span><p><span>【关于我们】</span></p><span></span><p><span>Lynn：10年连续创业者，新茶饮品牌李茶德创始人（小红书@</span><a href="https://www.xiaohongshu.com/user/profile/5b74dda2ba9ee90001030f5b?xsec_token=YBjiSHbB2lyWKbhYmAXRwikX0c6qVv_-0swLBrhUN7jRk=&amp;xsec_source=app_share&amp;xhsshare=CopyLink&amp;appuid=593a39fa50c4b42698c3854d&amp;apptime=1751968057&amp;share_id=a3d5ee04e32e47a9aca5292abdcb527d" data-url="https://www.xiaohongshu.com/user/profile/5b74dda2ba9ee90001030f5b?xsec_token=YBjiSHbB2lyWKbhYmAXRwikX0c6qVv_-0swLBrhUN7jRk=&amp;xsec_source=app_share&amp;xhsshare=CopyLink&amp;appuid=593a39fa50c4b42698c3854d&amp;apptime=1751968057&amp;share_id=a3d5ee04e32e47a9aca5292abdcb527d"><span>令姐来了</span></a><span>）</span></p><span></span><p><span>Serena：Ureka 普拉提场馆教学总监 （小红书@</span><a href="https://www.xiaohongshu.com/user/profile/5630d77b0bf90c37bcbf2c76?xsec_token=ABwQ3KVbZeVXU3iBGf8O8Yvz-G-5zZpXX6bDrak8n4g3U=&amp;xsec_source=pc_search" data-url="https://www.xiaohongshu.com/user/profile/5630d77b0bf90c37bcbf2c76?xsec_token=ABwQ3KVbZeVXU3iBGf8O8Yvz-G-5zZpXX6bDrak8n4g3U=&amp;xsec_source=pc_search"><span>Serena_yang</span></a><span>）</span></p><span></span><p><span>片尾曲：SKUNK - Feel of Summer</span></p><span></span><p><a href="https://afdian.net/a/gbgirls" data-url="https://afdian.net/a/gbgirls"><span>☕️请我们喝咖啡吧</span></a></p><span></span><p><span>场地支持：</span></p><span></span><p><span>杭州钱江新城毅风酒店-声音实验室</span></p><span></span><p><span>CPA中文播客会客厅</span></p>]]></description>
