  <item>
    <title>136 好运不是玄学，而是一种可复制的实力</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/68ad5ae7293471fed4854a1e</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">68ad5ae7293471fed4854a1e</guid>
    <pubDate>Wed, 27 Aug 2025 03:00:00 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>“幸运到底从哪里来？”这一期，我们把“幸运”从玄学拉回日常，当机会不是天降，而是你一次次选择的结果，“好运”就变成了可练的肌肉。</span></p><span></span><p><span>如果你最近觉得“运气不站你这边”，在职场或关系中总是“软不下来”、情绪容易被带跑——这期会给你一套可落地的“幸运训练法”。</span></p><span></span><p><span>本期主播：Elly vs Lynn</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FprYYPbPIsvzmc6mrHAaWzu642PR.png"></figure><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="92">01:32</a> 你觉得自己是幸运的人吗？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="125">02:05</a> “幸运是主观体感”：用语言给自己定调，我是幸运体质</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="327">05:27</a> 早晨口头禅/愿景墙：“I’m such a lucky girl.” 把叙事变成日常仪式</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="565">09:25</a> 金钱的好关系=不匮乏的安全感</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="661">11:01</a> 为何“自洽的人”自然有吸引力</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="789">13:09</a> “语言的柔软是功利的硬实力”</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="950">15:50</a> 给外卖/快递小哥递水，点亮他人也点亮自己</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1270">21:10</a> 先稳住，再解决，你是个会认错的人吗？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1390">23:10</a> 面对价值观不一致的长辈：不争对错，以退为进，省时省心</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1504">25:04</a>为什么说 “EGO 大，反而更柔软”</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1582">26:22</a> 机会留给有准备且勇敢的人：主动是比“能干”更高级的品质</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1679">27:59</a> 别扫自己的兴：如果被放鸽子，也要出门耍耍</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2198">36:38</a> 主动的人，设计幸运人生</span></p><span></span><p><span>愿你我都是幸运鹅。</span></p><span></span><p><span>片尾曲：Honeywhip - Flowers</span></p><span></span><p><span>【关于我们】</span></p><span></span><p><span>Lynn：10年连续创业者，新茶饮李茶德品牌创始人（小红书@</span><a href="https://www.xiaohongshu.com/user/profile/5b74dda2ba9ee90001030f5b?xsec_token=YBjiSHbB2lyWKbhYmAXRwikX0c6qVv_-0swLBrhUN7jRk=&amp;xsec_source=app_share&amp;xhsshare=CopyLink&amp;appuid=593a39fa50c4b42698c3854d&amp;apptime=1751968057&amp;share_id=a3d5ee04e32e47a9aca5292abdcb527d" data-url="https://www.xiaohongshu.com/user/profile/5b74dda2ba9ee90001030f5b?xsec_token=YBjiSHbB2lyWKbhYmAXRwikX0c6qVv_-0swLBrhUN7jRk=&amp;xsec_source=app_share&amp;xhsshare=CopyLink&amp;appuid=593a39fa50c4b42698c3854d&amp;apptime=1751968057&amp;share_id=a3d5ee04e32e47a9aca5292abdcb527d"><span>令姐来了</span></a><span>）</span></p><span></span><p><span>Elly：BecomingQueen品牌创始人，共学堂创始人（微博@</span><a href="https://weibo.com/morningbitchesDOTCOM" data-url="https://weibo.com/morningbitchesDOTCOM"><span>早安小王老师</span></a><span>）</span></p><span></span><p><a href="https://afdian.net/a/gbgirls" data-url="https://afdian.net/a/gbgirls"><span>☕️请我们喝咖啡吧</span></a></p>]]></description>
