  <item>
    <title>132 生活里那些奇奇怪怪的转运小知识</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/687f3deba9dec92500909447</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">687f3deba9dec92500909447</guid>
    <pubDate>Wed, 23 Jul 2025 03:00:00 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>本期主播：Serena vs Lynn</span></p><span></span><p><span>S老师忙里偷闲去韩国旅行回来了，分享宝藏吃喝的同时竟然还有开运指南！一起来听。</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FqTze5HjnDQEjs6jqcTIoUzZGM6E.jpg"></figure><span></span><p><span>- <a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="62">01:02</a> 救命，普拉提老师的旅行计划里怎么还有身体练习</span></p><span></span><p><span>- <a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="343">05:43</a> 住酒店不住头跟尾,为啥？</span></p><span></span><p><span>- <a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="425">07:05</a> 随身带点一根檀香净化空间还能“测测”空间能量</span></p><span></span><p><span>- <a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1056">17:36</a> 在韩国Labubu抢疯了，那家里到底能不能放“有眼睛”的小玩具呢</span></p><span></span><p><span>- <a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1536">25:36</a> 在美业发达的首尔，美丽标准常换常新，你知道“贴面耳”和“精灵耳”的寓意吗</span></p><span></span><p><span>- <a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1780">29:40</a> 姐姐们步入40好像都爱上了水晶，外部能量真得能提升运势吗</span></p><span></span><p><span>- <a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2443">40:43</a> 定期在家大扫除不仅清扫负能量，还有可能找到多年丢失的宝物</span></p><span></span><p><span>- <a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2527">42:07</a> 阳台可是风水宝地，就像一个“大口袋”，放棵绿植没准儿能招财</span></p><span></span><p><span>- <a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2893">48:13</a> 场外嘉宾Jade发言：她竟然有满满一个相册的水晶原石搭配图</span></p><span></span><p><span>- <a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3117">51:57</a> 家里有悬梁不仅压运还会影响健康，怎么破</span></p><span></span><p><span>无比欢乐轻松的一期聊天，想想片头说的“我们是一个闲聊栏目”（笑）就让这期闲聊陪伴大家开启美好的下半年。记住，所有的好运都在我们自己手里，一秒都别怀疑！</span></p><span></span><p><span>【关于我们】</span></p><span></span><p><span>Lynn：10年连续创业者，新茶饮李茶德品牌创始人（小红书@</span><a href="https://www.xiaohongshu.com/user/profile/5b74dda2ba9ee90001030f5b?xsec_token=YBjiSHbB2lyWKbhYmAXRwikX0c6qVv_-0swLBrhUN7jRk=&amp;xsec_source=app_share&amp;xhsshare=CopyLink&amp;appuid=593a39fa50c4b42698c3854d&amp;apptime=1751968057&amp;share_id=a3d5ee04e32e47a9aca5292abdcb527d" data-url="https://www.xiaohongshu.com/user/profile/5b74dda2ba9ee90001030f5b?xsec_token=YBjiSHbB2lyWKbhYmAXRwikX0c6qVv_-0swLBrhUN7jRk=&amp;xsec_source=app_share&amp;xhsshare=CopyLink&amp;appuid=593a39fa50c4b42698c3854d&amp;apptime=1751968057&amp;share_id=a3d5ee04e32e47a9aca5292abdcb527d"><span>令姐来了</span></a><span>）</span></p><span></span><p><span>Serena：Ureka 普拉提场馆教学总监 （小红书@</span><a href="https://www.xiaohongshu.com/user/profile/5630d77b0bf90c37bcbf2c76?xsec_token=ABwQ3KVbZeVXU3iBGf8O8Yvz-G-5zZpXX6bDrak8n4g3U=&amp;xsec_source=pc_search" data-url="https://www.xiaohongshu.com/user/profile/5630d77b0bf90c37bcbf2c76?xsec_token=ABwQ3KVbZeVXU3iBGf8O8Yvz-G-5zZpXX6bDrak8n4g3U=&amp;xsec_source=pc_search"><span>Serena_yang</span></a><span>）</span></p><span></span><p><span>片尾曲：수우 (soowoo) - Fallin into you</span></p><span></span><p><a href="https://afdian.net/a/gbgirls" data-url="https://afdian.net/a/gbgirls"><span>☕️请我们喝咖啡吧</span></a></p>]]></description>
